# Git does not track empty directories, so without this file `frontend/public/`
# does not exist in a fresh checkout -- and the Dockerfile's
# `COPY --from=build /app/public ./public` fails with
#   lstat /kaniko/1/app/public: no such file or directory
# A local build works fine (the directory exists on disk), so this only ever
# shows up in CI. Cost one build to learn.
#
# Delete this file once there is a real asset in here.
